        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur GEOFAVCOM, Fifth Avenue Knob With Georgetown Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDesigned to enhance any setting where a modern, sophisticated look is desired this Fifth Avenue Knob and Georgetown Deadbolt Combo Pack is both elegant and timeless. What is best about this ball knobset is that it will never go out of style--a simple classic, it will look beautiful for years, no matter how many times you change the room's decor around it. This Grandeur Entry Door Combo Pack includes a high security single cylinder deadbolt meaning it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. The Fifth Avenue Knob With Georgetown Rose fits doors 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. It is easy to install and comes backed by a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-georgetown-series\"><b>Georgetown Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur GEOFAVCOM Fifth Avenue Knob With Georgetown Rose:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fifth Avenue Knob with Georgetown Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Knob Diameter: 2.24\"</li>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Knob Projection: 2.24\"</li>\r\n<li>Georgetown Rosette Diameter: 2.69\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Diameter: 2.69\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Projection: 0.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FAV-knob.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Fifth Avenue Knob Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GEO-rose.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Georgetown Rosette Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GEO-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Georgetown Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Fifth Avenue Knob and Georgetown Deadbolt Combo Pack",
                "description": "Grandeur GEOFAVCOM, Fifth Avenue Knob With Georgetown Rose - Designed to enhance any setting where a modern, sophisticated look is desired this Georgetown Rosette With Fifth Avenue Knob And Matching Deadbolt is both elegant and timeless. What is best about this ball knobset is that it will never go out of style--a simple classic, it will look beautiful for years, no matter how many times you change the room's decor around it. This Grandeur Entry Door Combo Pack includes a high security single cylinder deadbolt meaning it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. The Fifth Avenue Knob With Georgetown Rose fits doors 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. It is easy to install and comes backed by a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty.",
